      "label": "common_1305_botan_08",
      "hash64": "0B3CF2A82D4F1BAC",
      "text": "嗯、嗯！真的好厲害！\\n謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳！[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
